# Git Commits

- Never add Cursor or another AI tool as Author, Committer, `Co-authored-by`, or
  `Made-with` attribution.
- Never use `git commit --no-verify` or `-n`.
- Human `Co-authored-by` trailers for real people are allowed.
- After every commit, run `git log -1 --format='%an %ae%n%B'`. Amend immediately
  if forbidden attribution remains, then verify again before pushing.
- `.githooks/commit-msg` strips Cursor attribution, and the Cursor shell hook
  rejects attempts to bypass verification.
